<h2>Modeling (M)</h2>
<p>Modeling has no codes of its own: the standards flag modeling items with a star (<em>) inside the other categories (e.g. Creating Equations</em>, Quantities<em>, Modeling with Geometry</em>, most of Statistics). On the ladder, modeling is carried by the science side rungs (·phys, ·chem, ·bio, ·comp) and the "And then" rows. The built ones are 5·chem, 5·bio, 6·phys, 7·phys, 8·phys, 9·phys, 9·bio, 10·bio, 11·chem, 12·phys, 13·phys and 13·chem. The starred items above are scored where they sit.</p>
