<h2>AP Calculus AB and BC</h2>
<p>Source: College Board, AP Calculus AB and AP Calculus BC Course and Exam Description (with the clarifications effective fall 2026, which change no topics) — https://apcentral.collegeboard.org/media/pdf/ap-calculus-ab-and-bc-course-and-exam-description.pdf ; https://apcentral.collegeboard.org/media/pdf/ap-calculus-ab-bc-course-and-exam-description-clarifications-effective-fall-2026.pdf . (BC) marks BC-only topics; Units 9 and 10 are BC only (10.2 Working with Geometric Series is BC only too). Some topic titles in Units 3–10 were cut off in the PDF text the tool could read; those were filled from the same CED's standard topic list, which has been unchanged since 2019.</p>
